### 1. Обычный JSON — ожидаем 200
POST http://localhost:3001/echo
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Artem"
}

### 2. Некорректный JSON — ожидаем 400
POST http://localhost:3001/echo
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":

### 3. Пустое тело — ожидаем 400
POST http://localhost:3001/echo
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 0


### 4. Превышение лимита 1 МиБ — ожидаем 413
POST http://localhost:3001/echo
Content-Type: application/json

< ./oversize.json

### 5. Ровно 1 МиБ — ожидаем 200
POST http://localhost:3001/echo
Content-Type: application/json

< ./exact-limit.json